# Screens

- Functional components typed with `React.FC`. Props use an interface.
- Colocate a screen with its feature in `src/features/<feature>/`.
- Navigate with React Navigation (`useNavigation`, `useRoute`). Do not import `expo-router`.
- Style with `StyleSheet.create` and `src/theme/colors.ts`.
- Name press handlers (`handleRemove`) instead of inline arrows in JSX.
- Give inputs an `accessibilityLabel`. Icon-only presses need a label too.

```tsx
// ❌
<Pressable onPress={() => remove(exercise.id)} />

// ✅
const handleRemove = useCallback(() => {
  onRemove(exercise.id);
}, [exercise.id, onRemove]);
```
